{"name":"Hancock","hex":"#4d6968","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Hancock","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A surname originating as a patronymic.","A number of places in the United States:\nA township in Hancock County, Illinois.\nA township in Plymouth County, Iowa.\nA minor city in Pottawattamie County, Iowa.\nA township in Osborne County, Kansas.\nA town in Hancock County, Maine.\nA town in Washington County, Maryland.\nA town in Berkshire County, Massachusetts.\nA city and township in Houghton County, Michigan.\nA township in Carver County, Minnesota.\nA minor city in Stevens County, Minnesota.\nAn unincorporated community in Pulaski County, Missouri.\nA town and census-designated place therein, in Hillsborough County, New Hampshire.\nA town and village therein, in Delaware County, New York.\nA neighbourhood of Austin, Texas.\nA town in Addison County, Vermont.\nA town and village therein, in Waushara County, Wisconsin.\nEllipsis of Hancock County."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Hancock"}],"entries":[{"title":"Hancock, Iowa","blocks":[{"text":"Hancock is a city in Pottawattamie County, Iowa, United States, along the West Nishnabotna River. The population was 200 at the time of the 2020 census."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/32/Hancock%2C_Iowa_Post_Office.jpg/330px-Hancock%2C_Iowa_Post_Office.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hancock%2C_Iowa","wikidata":"Q1000186"},{"title":"Hancock, Maine","blocks":[{"text":"Hancock is a town in Hancock County, Maine, United States. The population was 2,466 at the 2020 census."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b7/Glimpse_of_the_Taunton_River%2C_Hancock%2C_ME.jpg/330px-Glimpse_of_the_Taunton_River%2C_Hancock%2C_ME.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hancock%2C_Maine","wikidata":"Q937074"},{"title":"Hancock (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Hancock is a 2008 American superhero film starring Will Smith in the titular role as John Hancock, an amnesiac, alcoholic, reckless superhuman trying to remember his past. The film was directed by Peter Berg and written by Vince Gilligan and Vy Vincent Ngo. The film also stars Charlize Theron, Jason Bateman and Eddie Marsan."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/c/c9/Hancockposter.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hancock_(film)","wikidata":"Q220376"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b4/HancockIowaPopPlot.png/500px-HancockIowaPopPlot.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b4/HancockIowaPopPlot.png/1280px-HancockIowaPopPlot.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b4/HancockIowaPopPlot.png/500px-HancockIowaPopPlot.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The population of Hancock, Iowa from US census data","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHancockIowaPopPlot.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/64/Street_Scene%2C_Hancock%2C_ME.jpg/500px-Street_Scene%2C_Hancock%2C_ME.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/64/Street_Scene%2C_Hancock%2C_ME.jpg/500px-Street_Scene%2C_Hancock%2C_ME.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Street scene c. 1908","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AStreet_Scene%2C_Hancock%2C_ME.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/66/Town_Hall%2C_School_and_Railway_Station%2C_Hancock%2